abstract: >
  This artifact contains the locked experimental results,
  configuration files, verification scripts, and supporting
  simulation outputs for the evaluation of a mobility-aware
  multi-UAV edge-cloud trust management framework for falsified
  vehicular beacon detection under UAV handover and packet loss.
